 "spec": "# Author's PARAPHRASE of RFC 1122 section 4.2.2.13 (not the RFC text; see SOURCES.md and MODELLING.md)\n[I-01] A host MAY implement a half-duplex close, after which the application cannot read further data.\n[I-02] If a host with half-duplex close closes the connection while received data is still pending, its TCP SHOULD send a reset to show the data was lost.\n",
 "spec_sha256": "cfb46a000cdf54f032b41d8c06306db17f60758ec132406ca625c414c24cfebb",
